{"access":"public","aliases":[],"assertions":[{"claim_ids":["clm_1adb6bac7f50642824479c1726ff6a8b3943720e460b56be806e14ace5d7183a"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The combination of tiktoken, beautifulsoup4, and langchain-text-splitters suggests text ingestion/embedding pipelines, but this is inferred from dependency names only, not from inspected code."},{"claim_ids":["clm_2ea125b1e2d4d1c6be33acdbc9d90ac168534ef8f77ed30e6ad6e78383a042bc"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"LLM provider clients appear among pinned dependencies: openai 0.28.0 and cohere 4.53."},{"claim_ids":["clm_53561d1bfd8c007c28665cab85aefdb9b177f08e7a00d2386f08b6ab6c0581c2"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The project pins Django 4.0 and djangorestframework 3.14.0 in its requirements file, indicating a Django-based REST backend."},{"claim_ids":["clm_b01c4ddc35ffa858f36f3fe376bd88864c32e39e1199a15e4112be8c88ef6874"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"LangChain-related packages are pinned, including langchain 0.1.11, langchain-community 0.0.27, langchain-core 0.1.30, and langchain-text-splitters 0.0.1."},{"claim_ids":["clm_c7b5a9f173b5f32ed73381a7c37327556964530ab140c084ca4d5039c331a4b1"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"All dependencies are exactly pinned with == version specifiers, and several pins are notably dated (e.g., Django 4.0, pandas 1.5.3, pydantic 1.10.8)."},{"claim_ids":["clm_d9c56a6a4dc9071d32def5606743097aad29b82e7a76bd4f548b38bb2d94ca69"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Deployment-related libraries gunicorn 21.2.0 and loguru 0.7.2 are pinned alongside web/async packages such as aiohttp, uvicorn-absent asgiref, and SQLAlchemy 2.0.28."},{"claim_ids":["clm_fb4dde471b4bac4e82e61139b5586e77b0fb23fa25a0d417624590a9586db68b"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"pinecone-client 2.2.4 is pinned, suggesting a vector-store integration, though no code in the snapshot confirms its use."}],"claim_ids":["clm_1adb6bac7f50642824479c1726ff6a8b3943720e460b56be806e14ace5d7183a","clm_2ea125b1e2d4d1c6be33acdbc9d90